    "body": "Well, \"Nothing\" is technically correct in this case. I'd prefer \"Nothing; see prose\" here, and an extra note at [\"nothing\" content model](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#concept-content-nothing) clarifying that content model only describes DOM, not necessarily things that can go between those tags in HTML source text, and that there are indeed non-void elements whose content model is nothing.",
