    "body": "> Well, \"Nothing\" is technically correct in this case.\r\n\r\nTechnically correct isn’t necessarily a strong argument for keeping it, IMHO. Especially since this entire section is meant as guidance for authors/developers and not for implementors. So in this particular part of the spec, we should be optimizing for the information needs of authors/developers. And from #3021 we have evidence this this *Nothing*—while technically correct— may not be helpful to authors/developers in the way in the way we’d like, and may in fact be ambiguous or at least at strong risk of being misinterpreted.",
    "created_at": "2017-09-11T08:16:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-15T11:08:30Z",
